Cc: Linux-ALSA <alsa-devel@alsa-project.org>, Liam Girdwood <lgirdwood@gmail.com>, Simon <horms@verge.net.au>, Laurent <laurent.pinchart@ideasonboard.com>, Guennadi <g.liakhovetski@gmx.de>, Grant Likely <grant.likely@linaro.org>, Frank Rowand <frowand.list@gmail.com>, Linux-DT <devicetree@vger.kernel.org>, Linux-Kernel <linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org>
